And do you remember this outfit... well, not clothes, but this look? I appeared in the newspaper looking like this.

888
01:14:30,112 --> 01:14:42,612
あんきもも、あんきもも今とっても喜んでるよ。僕もお正月にでれたよって喜んでる。
