5 years ago, I never thought I'd be able to wear sleeves like this, but I didn't have sleeves!

895
01:15:36,319 --> 01:15:43,209
袖のない振り袖だったのかなね、5年たってちゃんと振り袖をこうやって切れるようになったり、
It's been 5 years, and I've finally learned to properly wear sleeves!

